  Calder Wheels — Admin Approval Workflow
  Deployed via Shopify Admin. No Liquid file needed — operates via
  customer tags and metafields set through the admin panel.

  ## Dealer Application to Approval Flow:

  1. Customer submits application via /pages/dealer-apply form
  2. The form POSTs to /apps/calder/dealer-apply (middleware webhook)
  3. Middleware tags the customer with 'dealer-applied'
  4. Admin reviews in Shopify Admin → Customers → filter by tag 'dealer-applied'

  ## Manual Approval Steps (Admin):

  Apply these tags to approve a dealer:

    dealer-approved     (required — gates all dealer functionality)
    dealer-tier-1      (required — 1=standard, 2=premium, 3=platinum)
    dealer-net-30       (optional — enables NET-30 payment terms)
    dealer-tax-exempt   (optional — tax exemption)

  ## Metafields to set on the customer:

    credit_limit       (number)   — e.g. 50000
    credit_used        (number)   — e.g. 0
    outstanding_balance (number)  — e.g. 0
    past_due           (number)   — e.g. 0
    account_status     (string)   — 'active', 'frozen', 'suspended'
    default_moq        (integer)  — default minimum order quantity
    quotes             (json)     — array of quote objects
    invoices           (json)     — array of invoice objects

  ## Tag-based permission matrix:

    Tag                          Effect
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    dealer-approved              enables all dealer sections
    dealer-tier-1                dealer-price shows Tier 1 pricing
    dealer-tier-2                dealer-price shows Tier 2 pricing
    dealer-tier-3                dealer-price shows Tier 3 pricing
    dealer-net-30                enables NET-30 payment terms
    dealer-tax-exempt            hides tax at checkout
    dealer-applied               shows pending interstitial
    dealer-only (on product)     hides from non-dealer customers

  ## Metafield namespace: custom (default)

    custom.is_configurable        (true/false)
    custom.design_code            (string)  — e.g. "201"
    custom.design_nickname        (string)  — e.g. "Apex"
    custom.series                 (string)  — 'forged', 'flow_formed', 'three_piece'
    custom.dealer_only            (true/false)
    custom.dealer_moq             (integer)
    custom.dealer_tier_1_price    (money)
    custom.dealer_tier_2_price    (money)
    custom.dealer_tier_3_price    (money)
    custom.bom                    (json)    — component BOM definition
    custom.variant_map            (json)    — config key → variant ID mapping
